OL,3,GNEWSACulture legacy could see music
OL,4,Afestivals return
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for two major Bradford arts
OL,7,Ffestivals look set to move forward as
OL,8,Fpart of the continuing legacy of the UK
OL,9,FCity of Culture year.
OL,11,FThe creation of a new music festival in
OL,12,FBingley, and the return of the original
OL,13,FBradford Mela, had already been hinted
OL,14,Fat by officials, and a council report
OL,15,Fconfirms they will be funded with
OL,16,Fmillions of pounds set aside for the
OL,17,FBradford 2025 follow-on programme.
OL,19,FThe report also says the size of the
OL,20,Flocal visitor economy soared to more
OL,21,Fthan #1bn in 2025, the first time that
OL,22,Fmilestone has been reached.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
