OL,3,GNEWSACulture legacy could see music
OL,4,Afestivals return
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut it raises questions over the future
OL,7,Fof the Bradford Culture Company Ltd,
OL,8,Fwith the council considering "whether,
OL,9,Fand in what form, it should continue".
